OL,3,ARoyal Mail plans to cut 2,500 head
OL,4,Aoffice jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPostal service firm Royal Mail has
OL,7,Fannounced plans to cut 2,500 head
OL,8,Foffice and other support jobs by the
OL,9,Fend of 2027.
OL,11,FFrontline postal workers - posties and
OL,12,Fdrivers - are not part of the proposed
OL,13,Frestructuring.
OL,15,FThe cuts will represent about 2% of the
OL,16,F131,000-strong workforce.
OL,18,FRoyal Mail said the workforce
OL,19,Freduction, designed to improve
OL,20,Fefficiency, would be achieved through
OL,21,Fvoluntary redundancies and people
OL,22,Fchoosing to leave the company.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
